{"id":"b89c7b657207c8cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Sharp Operator","display":"df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator — ZFC Inner2 Sharp Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator — ZFC Inner2 Sharp Operator","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator — ZFC Inner2 Sharp Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"812378a7c13a40e3\" href=\"?note=812378a7c13a40e3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" href=\"?note=3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f1db95b853d761e\" href=\"?note=0f1db95b853d761e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd \\in V\">\\(x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{pm}}\\in V\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{pm}}\\in V\\)</span> 是本定义固定的前鼠语言参数；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\)</span> 调用均使用这个相同参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}operator}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S(x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nx^\\#\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\lhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\exists M,\\vec E,\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nx^\\#=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land x\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(x^\\#,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(x^\\#,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle N,x^\\#\\rangle\\in\\lhd\\land N\\neq x^\\#\n\\to\\neg\\exists K,\\vec E_N,\\rho_N,p_N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nN=\\langle K,\\in,\\vec E_N\\rangle\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(N)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(N,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho_N,p_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(N,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}operator}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S(x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nx^\\#\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\lhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\exists M,\\vec E,\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nx^\\#=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land x\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(x^\\#,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(x^\\#,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle N,x^\\#\\rangle\\in\\lhd\\land N\\neq x^\\#\n\\to\\neg\\exists K,\\vec E_N,\\rho_N,p_N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nN=\\langle K,\\in,\\vec E_N\\rangle\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(N)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(N,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho_N,p_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(N,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lhd\">\\(\\lhd\\)</span> explicitly supply the candidate-premouse set and its proper-initial-segment relation.</li>\n<li>The sharp is represented by the least proper initial segment that is an active, sound, iterable premouse over the parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"1048d44b28527ff2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"812378a7c13a40e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e2c90c7f1f68c14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f1db95b853d761e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\mathrm{pm}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}sharp\\text{-}operator}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2SharpOperator}_S(x^\\#,x,\\mathcal B,\\lhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nx^\\#\\in\\mathcal B\n\\land\\lhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\n\\land\\exists M,\\vec E,\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nx^\\#=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\n\\land x\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(x^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(x^\\#,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(x^\\#,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle N,x^\\#\\rangle\\in\\lhd\\land N\\neq x^\\#\n\\to\\neg\\exists K,\\vec E_N,\\rho_N,p_N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nN=\\langle K,\\in,\\vec E_N\\rangle\n\\land x\\in K\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(N)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(N,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho_N,p_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(N,\\omega_1+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\lhd","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2134,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator.md|58-df-zfc-inner2-sharp-operator]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1048d44b28527ff2","812378a7c13a40e3","3e2c90c7f1f68c14","0f1db95b853d761e"]}